{
  "id": "MRK.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Marko 2",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo ng’ei ceng’ moko kan emondo i Kapernaum kendo, juwinjo nia eni i ot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dupa gicokri karacelo, ketho kabedo mbe igi kendo cil dhugola de mbe: man eyero igi lembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gibino, ma gikelo ng’atu ma won tho ma nego kum nding’ i bang’e, ma juang’wen giyeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ka gicopo tundo ceng’ni i bang’e ngo ni njuru dhanu, e giyeco wi ot kpa ka wie: ka giyeco, giluro ng’atu ma won tho ma nego kum nding’ ku kavuto m’evuto i wie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Yesu neno yioyic migi ewacu ni won tho ma nego kum nding’ kumae, Wodo, dubo peri juweko woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento jumoko ma kind jugorcik nuti ma gibedo keca, ma giporo lembe i adundegi kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’atuni weco kumeno nedi? eyero lembacidi kum Mungu: ng’a ma copo weko dubo woko ndhu ng’atu acel, en e Mungu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E eni eni Yesu, m’eng’eyo i cwinye nia giporo lembe i igi gigi, ewacu igi kumae, Wuporo lembe maeni i adundewu nedi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makani ma yot ma sagu, wacu ni won tho ma nego kum nding’ kumae, Dubo peri juweko woko; kadi wacu kumae, Ai malu, ting’ kavuto peri iwothi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento kara wung’ei nia Wod dhanu bedo ku ng’ol wi ng’om mi wekodubo woko (ewacu ni won tho ma nego kum nding’ kumae), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awacu iri kumae, Ai malu ting’ kavuto peri, icidh i ot peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eai malu, eting’o kavuto tho, e ewok woko i wang’gi ceke; ketho kagi ceke igi wang’ lii, man giyungo Mungu, giwacu kumae, Naka fodi waneno wagi eni ki ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ecidho kendo dhu nam; udul dhanu ceke gicidho i bang’e de, e eponjogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinde m’ebekadhu, eneno Lawi ma wod Alfayo m’ubedo ka ma jujoko ie ajok, man ewacu ire kumae, Lub ng’eya. E eai malu elubo ng’eye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E etimbre, nia ebedo dhu cam i ot pare man weg ajok ku judubo dupa gibedo piny giku Yesugi man julubne: kum gi dupa, man gilubo ng’eye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jugorcik mi Jufarisayo ka gineno nia gibecamu ku judubo ku weg ajok de, giwacu ni julubne kumae, Nedi ecamu emadhu de ku weg ajok ku judubo de? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Yesu winjo maeni, ewacu igi kumae, Ju ma kumgi leng’ can jakeikum negogi ngo, ento ju ma kumgi lith re: abino Lwong’o weg bedopwe ngo, ento judubo re.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Julub Yohana ku Jufarisayo de gibekwiro cam: e gibino giwacu ire kumae, Julub Yohana ku julub Jufarisayo gikwiro cam nedi, ka julubni ke gikwiro cam ungo e? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu wacu igi kumae, Wot won ambadha gicopo kwiro cam, ma fodi won ambadha ginuti gikugi? ma fodi ginuti giku won ambadhagi, gicopo kwiro cam ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ceng’ bibino, ma jubikabu ie won ambadha woko kud i bang’gi, e gibilund kwiro cam i ceng’ maeno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’atu moko mbe ma kwoyo wang’ kendi m’uti ku kurembo ma nyen: kara kurembo bongu ma nyen nica ma juthube ko kud elund eyec m’uti, edwoke rac ma sagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’atu moko mbe de ma piko pigulok ma nyasa i usaupigulok m’uti; kara pigulok kud ung’eny usaupigulok, pigulok de kud uoi, usaupigulok kud unyothre: ento pigulok ma nyasa jupiko i usaupigulok ma nyen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.23.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 23:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, nia ebekadhu ku kind podhocam i ceng’ sabatu; e julubne, ka gibecidho, gimaku jaku jang cam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jufarisayo giwacu ire kumae, Nen, nedi gitimo maeno ma cik uyio ngo ceng’ sabatu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu igi kumae, Fodi wusomo ngo gin ma Daudi timo, ka canpiny unege, ku kec de, en, ku ju ma ginuti gikugi de? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.24.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 24:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.21.1+1SA.21.2+1SA.21.3+1SA.21.4+1SA.21.5+1SA.21.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 21:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maram emondo ko i ot pa Mungu kende ma Abiathar en e jalam ma dit, ecamu kwen mir anyutha, ma cik uyio ngo ya jucam ndhu ni julam, man emio de ni ju ma ginuti gikugi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu igi kumae, Jutimo ceng’ sabatu ni dhanu, jutimo dhanu ngo ni ceng’sabatu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
